msgstr "HD VTX 连接器上默认提供 DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:56 3560dee18a3543408ae2ab2742127490
#: 73b610d56b2142aea0318af66d6a9001 d0747a6215eb4e1585487b89f2a61598
