#: fba8df226af24bd2a90c65c721b21f30
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "VTX 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:57 0d13f5e6a13a49a7a916612f41227ecf
#: 5efcf1f34b8741af9ed88a7af6052da8 793c2d0491ee420cb357d86181536418
#: d565c08c1854431cbab353373151d647 e324236bbb9d4cc1869841c2e3ce65d6
#: ebf712d449f44bd3afcc14073589fec0
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol"
" defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 10v so be careful not to"
" connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v. DisplayPort OSD is enabled by "
"default on SERIAL8."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 连接器支持 DJI Air Unit / HD VTX 连接，协议默认为 DisplayPort。连接器第 1 引脚为 "
"10V，请勿将其连接至需要 5V 的外设。SERIAL8 上默认启用 DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:60 8012c0bb3a3549fc907b81bea5970258
#: a769f9b684024817bf553731cee9e564 abb6fa0f5c844d41bf4f48fa40da1ebc
#: c909661f6da643448a0da230dec556aa def4f10ded27497ab8e7933eaf52e9fd
#: f25c478c0a7c4142b0f58ba5748add47
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:61 549505d5ebf44171925b44ff26899b85
#: 8dbf22836f9d427ba1b67ff1a25f3e22 cc9d487a57cf4128b30372cca5039086
#: d4d8b518e314443c8c9c82919d1b3ed3 d5bafd8058e547e18922e5b89123990b
#: db42d7380774488c86d6bcd23b2a8bfd
msgid ""
"GPIO 83 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"12V\" and is included "
"on the HD VTX connector. Setting this GPIO low removes voltage supply to "
"this pin/pad. By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets "
"the GPIO high at boot."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 83 控制标记为「12V」引脚和 HD VTX 连接器的 VTX BEC 输出。将该 GPIO "
"设为低电平可断开该引脚/焊盘的供电。默认情况下，RELAY3 配置为控制此引脚，并在启动时将 GPIO 置为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:64 115dd2b6021c427cb5fe626e3239dd0a
#: 262075b4d4f240a4a62243b91715f9a0 6720f8ed905642d991e0a92e263999d6
