#: ef873d603de24f6992182fa37b5fe552
msgid ""
"The autopilot supports up to 9 PWM (8 + LED) outputs. The pads for motor "
"output M1 to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate "
"pads, plus M9 on a separate pad for LED strip (default configuration) or "
"another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"飞控最多支持 9 路 PWM（8 路 + LED）输出。电机输出焊盘 M1 至 M8 在电机连接器和独立焊盘上均有提供，另有 M9 "
"在独立焊盘上，默认配置为 LED 灯带，也可用于其他 PWM 输出。"

